{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e8a5dd5d91fe230642fc64d0bfe7578376366ed47b2dc9866e0653026b0b9b6e", "ja": "センター公演を得意なダンス中心のステージ\nでいくことにした歩。ダンスの方向性で迷走\nするが、プロデューサーのアドバイスもあり、\nメンバー全員が主役のような、一体感のある\nステージをテーマにすることに決める。", "zh": "步决定以她擅长的舞蹈，\n作为Center公演的主要表演内容。\n她原先对舞蹈风格拿不定主意，\n但在制作人的建议下，决定采用仿佛\n所有的成员都是主角、充满一体感的表演作为主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a64f7a818740d04d7310133e7a994952d98bd930e4be4e57b26f8724ba20cc4", "ja": "（歩のセンター公演の告知は出したし、\n今やるべきことは一段落したかな）", "zh": "（已经公告步的Center公演消息，\n目前该做的事算是告一段落了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1001_p", "source_sha256": "387cc1fbc872c80f6d44cfec196e2da21ac8a7de000825a92e7615aeda350e77", "ja": "そういえば、歩の調子はどうだろう。\nこの間はずいぶんと緊張してたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "对了，不知道步的情况怎么样。\n她之前看起来相当紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fb88a7451b158311d254a256d08f0b50870cef1a79b7a609a02d542d3d342d21", "ja": "お、歩。ちょうどいいところに……って、\nどうしたんだ？　なんだか真剣な顔して。", "zh": "哦，步，你来得正好……咦？\n怎么了？你的表情看起来很严肃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7a7c37c08c22e7fcf5e6cc883851c85e436534917846fbeb0311f0d315dd7985", "ja": "えっと……ちょっとさ、{$P$}に\n相談したいことがあって。", "zh": "那个……我有件事，\n想跟{$P$}商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65d4bc820f461ccd7bee198d742efeb27f1cae570f52fc9f89a3330df9304bf7", "ja": "相談？\nもちろん構わないけど、何かあったのか。", "zh": "有事找我商量？\n当然可以啊，发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d216ebc273965edeec50170f7005adc802f1d000bcc3a035733fae0148f97949", "ja": "うん。実は、今度の公演のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，其实是关于这次的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3ef4a3c50d6f6565a756619f4ce4e5630ac6c54e5413650838064f950cd89c18", "ja": "（なんだか、深刻そうだな。……はっ！？\nまさか、センターを降りたいとか言い出す気じゃ……）", "zh": "（总觉得好严肃……啊！？\n难不成她想要放弃当Center……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1008_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "d861131dbd8bc699110f9338b56b9fb6d83e104f9b1dba03ad3b4bd9d38e2bef", "ja": "はいほー！　歩ちゃん、発見なのです！\nエレナちゃん、ここにいたのですよ！", "zh": "Hi Ho！发现小步了唷！\n小艾琳娜，她在这里的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c5e5ef90fb46ba179429786bdee853ee8ed2537935d07fca85793ab47ae949c", "ja": "{$P$}と一緒だったんだネ！\nレッスンルームにいないから、探しちゃったヨ～。", "zh": "原来你和{$P$}在一起呀！\n你不在练习室里，所以我们都在找你呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf6e85c7e672e1cad9946afed68c0c0af3b030fe548ee3c2e8aac15b730994bd", "ja": "アユム、ワタシとマツリと一緒にレッスンしよっ。\nレッスンは、みんなと一緒のほうが楽しいヨ～♪", "zh": "步，跟我和茉莉一起练习吧。\n练习要大家一起来比较开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6864e1c7af3f68d77e3f387d587d59ab279ba621e503318cded82e505da1e044", "ja": "まつり、エレナ……ちょうどよかった！　ふたりも\n{$P$}と一緒に、聞いてくれないか？", "zh": "茉莉、艾琳娜……你们来得正好！\n能跟{$P$}一起听我说句话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "b25577c75a6c930405155d1d64e778770784750704da1541977000c567c034b9", "ja": "ほ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "2a3563cb3e2fff40f773b1283c4d9ce6b599b56e2dd6cc96c4cacb4c72bf4b08", "ja": "アユム……？", "zh": "步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "239521f280d638ed0b4168194ad9315f20a5d3db6687e1c4258a5d78018e4ee7", "ja": "えっとさ。アタシ……\n次の公演は、絶対に成功させたいんだ！", "zh": "就是呢，我……\n绝对要让下次的公演成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "140ae0a628934b4bf1ec85a889e7b1edb04297382f6fc9771b262cb3f3a94070", "ja": "アタシひとりじゃ、大したことできないけどさ。\nでもみんな一緒なら、スゴいステージにできると思う！", "zh": "光靠我一个人做不了什么大事，但是跟大家一起合作，\n一定能完成非常棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "16c17174a2d198143e70ca7cbc432797c776ba050e206d694b55701e84892c6f", "ja": "だからふたりとも、アタシに力を貸してほしいんだ！\nお願いっ！　このとおりっ！", "zh": "所以啰，我想拜托你们两个助我一臂之力！\n拜托！求求你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ec4d7c82779ef8d4702d8dd68061cf289a45e2091a414f51fc08867deded38b9", "ja": "（歩……）", "zh": "（步……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "7ec031a8d365b79eec7cb73912dfca0253aa8ec231ee6b828ceef3def77613b4", "ja": "ウン！　もちろんだヨ、アユム！\n今度のライブは、ワタシもすっごく楽しみだからネ♪", "zh": "嗯！我当然要帮忙啦，步！\n因为我也非常期待这次的演唱会嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "ecf3a5253e9c89ff4f3ff946b30c31f3ae3d84c96c790deb17ee2598fd1b163e", "ja": "もちろん、姫も手伝うのですよ。センターの歩ちゃんを\nとびきり・びゅーてぃほー！に輝かせるのです！", "zh": "公主当然也会帮忙的喔。\n要让小步这个Center耀眼到超～美丽的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12294db44cb91b76df9f7e288d7a199f6017a5ac8096ecf543eefc9708a7ad1a", "ja": "び、びゅーてぃほー……？　よくわかんないけど、\nま、いいや。ふたりとも、サンキューッ！", "zh": "耀、耀眼到超美丽……？我不太懂你的意思，\n不过没关系，谢谢你们啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1022_p", "source_sha256": "54815a83f9db7a0e589c77749df00f02bdc99e7807e81ea947314313921ca99d", "ja": "よかったな、歩。最初、ずいぶん深刻そうな顔を\nしてたから、ちょっと心配したよ。", "zh": "太好了呢，步。\n起初你的表情相当严肃，我还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3fbf6cdeb552c929f545ded59a298555ec820f0f3e0fc1949565f02f670cb44f", "ja": "アハハ、ゴメン！　逃げ場をなくしておきたかったって\nいうか……みんなの前で、宣言しておきたかったんだ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，抱歉！怎么说呢，我就是想让自己无路可退……\n所以想在大家面前宣言一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6791ab1afa3c5eb8f1fae4d4656cba83468ff2ec43b98ac5e8e77751af3157b4", "ja": "不安が残ってないワケじゃないけど。\nここまで来たら、前に進むしかないっ！てさ！", "zh": "虽然心里不是没有丝毫不安，\n但都走到这一步了，就只能继续前进啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a8ee177e8ce624781bb7610018e07b97980fa130600cb0f87e56f64e23c46220", "ja": "うん、それでこそ歩だな。\nで、当面は、どうやって前に進むつもりなんだ？", "zh": "嗯，这样才像是步嘛。\n那你目前打算怎么前进？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "da3e8a61bdba299d74d0e7b0367fd018a7268945e7fbd52312f5151c2b9b0b8f", "ja": "それなんだよな～。歌いながら踊ると、\nつい歌がおろそかになっちゃうからさ。", "zh": "问题就是这个啊～\n我只要边唱歌边跳舞，就会不小心疏忽唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2749aa95ca9e4b05d41f5f491f1ef574af018813126bdf7b87a101e8e87042ce", "ja": "だから、歌のレッスンを増やしたほうがいいのかなって\n思ったんだけど。{$P$}、どう思う？", "zh": "所以我在想说，是不是应该增加歌唱训练课程比较好。\n{$P$}，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1028_p", "source_sha256": "959c643c6d92128aa5918aabd4781fbb0b0dc810dc72bae5de1ce00baa6b0c06", "ja": "そうだな。たしかに、\n苦手を克服することも大事だと思うけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛，\n克服弱点确实也很重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4cf165d6f5bdf6cbdf362c05706f02e24f0948c681c2a5cc47b541c82a050b47", "ja": "せっかく歩がセンターなんだ。\n歩の強みを活かしたほうがいいと思う。", "zh": "但是步好不容易当了Center，\n我觉得多运用你的强项比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bb83f15a2eb5353c411bb4859e25c8a7de4a83fc2226a2a124d0108127a7bde9", "ja": "アタシの強み……なら、当然ダンスだよな！\nダンスメインの公演……うん、ちょっと新しいかも？", "zh": "我的强项……那当然是跳舞啰！\n以舞蹈为主的公演……嗯，说不定有点创新喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "96ffa10b80ae4f45bee8f2d8aacd676fe7f8c55411f8275c83fad1f70f64200f", "ja": "ワタシ、歩のダンス大好きだヨ！\n一緒に踊ってて、すっごく楽しいしネ♪", "zh": "我最喜欢步的舞蹈了喔！\n跟你一起跳舞非常快乐呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "de1da5661c4cec3d88a6449cd02cdb68378fae323d5f6766e69b70d04c0ce422", "ja": "歩ちゃんとダンスがメインの公演、だいなみっくで、\nぱわほー！なステージになりそうなのです。", "zh": "以小步跟舞蹈为主的公演，\n看来这场表演会是充满活力又强大的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2bbc17b4aa22a1bbc830d0a94776ac4875d0108cde6d4f09390b82d52a313b02", "ja": "そ、そう……？　ありがとな！\nへへっ……♪", "zh": "是、是吗……？谢啦！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fab93d41f277bc6748eccba2d06554f30f694845f77aa329b94b7f66591ada1b", "ja": "よし……決めたよ、{$P$}！\n今度の公演は、ダンス中心のステージだ！", "zh": "好……我决定了，{$P$}！\n这次公演就是以舞蹈为主的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f4424109abdcfd9a8feb66fd766b99b0df2e421683a04fc374d90ae4fac0488a", "ja": "わかった。他にも何かあれば、遠慮なく言ってくれ。\n歩のやりたい事を、どんどん取り入れていこう！", "zh": "我明白了。要是有其他需求都尽管跟我说。\n尽情在公演里融入步想做的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e780236c00db84ac7666eae1c621b1bb559ebd369628a26c842a229a70210325", "ja": "へへっ。アタシ、ちょっとやってみたいコトが\nあるんだ！　……あ、でもうまく入れられるかな？", "zh": "嘿嘿，我正好有个点子想试试看！\n……呃，可是真的能成功加进去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "7636fc0929aef82916dc5109a8d01934ce6ed1dff5c8917745e16d90f6073036", "ja": "歩ちゃん、歩ちゃん。まつりは、ふわふわで\nらぶりー！なダンスを踊る歩ちゃんが見たいのです。", "zh": "小步、小步，茉莉想要看小步的舞蹈！\n要跳轻飘飘又迷人的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cd4a6d54f207ed0bc4a7b66bf34f92ef8a8434892c22e014a31cefa90a9983c2", "ja": "へっ？　ふ、ふわふわで、らぶりーなダンス？", "zh": "啊？轻、轻飘飘又迷人的舞蹈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b45e1745fbcf5655b6d6d1a1e23e8ca542549d712268b313f4e328fc92f4b29c", "ja": "まつり、それは……どんなダンスなんだ？", "zh": "茉莉，那是……什么样的舞蹈啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "f84cde6fd3f1a7644ba29e271aab68457c6d1eacb1edf5178d776c00b287a7d9", "ja": "もちろん、とびきり・ふわふわで、\nそーきゅーと！なダンスなのです♪", "zh": "当然就是这样的舞蹈啊！\n超～轻飘飘，又超～可爱的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1f29219408a6478f363637803be7d110c9c08addc2fc351674b2a8f3c00455ae", "ja": "とびきり……ふわふわ！", "zh": "超……轻飘飘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1042_p", "source_sha256": "08b0bdcce66dc31ad23ae0d9b81756e3f9c331b53dceabaa9b5fc2cd05e9f3e5", "ja": "（！？　さすが歩だな、今ので……！）", "zh": "（咦！？真不愧是步，这样就懂了吗……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "54a9435e0c7e303b74702357399525271f40a5db4d9af2bdb49bacd7430d9c47", "ja": "ってダメだー。全然わからないよー……。", "zh": "不行啊，完全搞不懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1044_p", "source_sha256": "586e01e0a515b767a3d088c9ea326a56b61ac05e696ad10cbc89e200a83a77ad", "ja": "（わかってなかったのか……）", "zh": "（原来是根本没搞懂啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "1e04319b810d392d8e3e626212b11d8aa04e1b7cd8ee958220444240e9018aac", "ja": "このセンター公演で、歩ちゃんの新たな魅力を\nファンのみんなに見せるのです～！", "zh": "要利用这次的Center公演，\n展现小步的新魅力给粉丝们看的呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a48db12e4bcb40f18f4b3c6e5b1ff15ed36953403aefebc1fd19b9c7b70181a", "ja": "アユム！　ダンスといえば、やっぱりサンバだヨ～！\nお客さんも巻き込んで、みんなで踊ろっ♪", "zh": "步！说到跳舞，当然要跳森巴啰～！\n让观众也一起参与，大家一起跳森巴吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c2a0248bbb0afb77a371940eadb59137af425409875c2125f174f0fb58b86f2", "ja": "ステージも客席も、カーニバルだヨ～！", "zh": "台上台下都一起加入嘉年华～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1048_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c734a4c73ac5588bad63f97f68ad142228d207c31e04d2945d76432e088b8cbb", "ja": "そ、そうだな～……う～ん……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "9deed895a88c0ca0696c9968f7fa5a93b16bfd150dd9be50185020f5b0d48f2e", "ja": "ふっふっふ……話は聞かせてもらったよ、歩！", "zh": "呵呵呵……在下全都听见啰，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1050_034ayu", "source_sha256": "febff089fe6d5e134ac98f107a093db7da6e28fc4a4201a732befa8af9661abe", "ja": "！？　だ、誰だっ！？", "zh": "啊！？是、是谁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "1ff0ce36cb1eab8a9fa2e98b1660a08e0676040018b343436097f98cc46e6d21", "ja": "ダンスといえば、当然ボクの出番ですよね！\n劇場を舞い踊るダンスの妖精、菊地真でーす！", "zh": "说到跳舞，当然就要由在下出场啰！\n在下是剧场里翩翩起舞的舞蹈妖精，菊地真──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1052_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e638ba1fda407ba8cf4d79ea69770ed840481ca2fec70c767af68fa2ed628ecf", "ja": "真……！", "zh": "真……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "52eabc365aa62a28e16513f893483f950fae93308766a458898c501cd8e30fb9", "ja": "というワケで……ボクはやっぱり、\nアイドル～！って感じのダンスがいいと思いますっ！", "zh": "所以说……\n在下还是觉得有「偶像感～！」的舞蹈比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "7fbec2791b0163afaff686e0bee1d96906c9c5aa803f0a4d216e94183ce08a72", "ja": "キメポーズは、そうだな……\nきゃっぴきゃぴぴ、きゃぴる～ん☆で、決まりだね！", "zh": "至于招牌动作嘛，在下想想……\n就决定用「闪亮、闪亮亮、闪闪亮亮～☆」吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1055_013hib", "source_sha256": "14a18e36468f0b7bd8d0ef6f0b913e4e1056efc56da9ffbed67dca884913acda", "ja": "真、さっきから何言ってるか全然わからないぞ……。\nっていうか、ふわふわなダンスと何が違うのさ？", "zh": "真，本人从刚才就听不懂你在说什么耶……\n是说，这跟轻飘飘的舞蹈有什么不一样啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1056_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e17f3bfac2eec907c9f20f7aa38fc99a5a5430b3c5192d6ac6173773c03db447", "ja": "って、響！？", "zh": "呃，响！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d59852b948f43e111f7cd3601867fe823bacdb39d5978b56366307127845be2", "ja": "はいさーい！　歩、今度の公演でセンターなんだって？\n自分と真も、一緒に出させてもらうからね！", "zh": "嗨嗨～！步，听说你是这次公演的Center是吗？\n本人跟真也要一起上场表演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1058_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1fe552d597085ab5e3b817340731d21794f2aae294fe9801dc68e0aa660f90a5", "ja": "そうなの！？　真と響も一緒に……。あははっ、\n大歓迎だよっ！　みんなで最高のステージにしような！", "zh": "真的吗！？真跟响也要一起……啊哈哈，非常欢迎喔！\n大家一起打造出最棒的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1059_006mak", "source_sha256": "2bbb621b69eba8c0e3ec03dfda95536d6138b3f28779abed56e9d32cac650899", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　てことで、早速練習だ！\nきゃっぴきゃぴぴ、きゃぴる～ん☆", "zh": "这还用说！所以啰，我们马上来练习吧！\n「闪亮、闪亮亮、闪闪亮亮～☆」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1060_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ced95ae457da0df7a8098fca1c33bd1cbfe19c74031205ad015135cdad4ae19", "ja": "そんなのダメだぞ～。もっとこう、だーん、バーン、\nガーンってなるほうがいいに決まってるさー！", "zh": "这样不行喔～应该要更「咚──！」、「砰──！」、\n「轰──！」的才会比较好啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1061_034ayu", "source_sha256": "287437d75e28545d8238679dce3358f80d037a27bb6669d47dab15aed04a01ef", "ja": "えっ。えっと……きゃぴ、バーン、えっ？\nあ、それとふわふわの……ええと、サンバだっけ？", "zh": "咦？呃……「闪亮」、「砰──！」还有什么？\n啊，还有轻飘飘的……呃，森巴是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_1062", "source_sha256": "72dff1e869afcd54709fe67d3b1e0a9a5b3e8a8811911947833663ada4477746", "ja": "そこまで！", "zh": "到此为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2000_p", "source_sha256": "567d41a678cb7d14c4df18458fb4c4bc4c84a3d59e232259a7ed7f82d73cac3d", "ja": "はい、そこまで！\nみんな、いろんな意見をありがとうな。", "zh": "好，到此为止！\n各位，谢谢你们提供各式各样的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2001_p", "source_sha256": "65271689fe72ff952319c1c36d67a6e56bb27e1383785ac8505230c1c86fe4c9", "ja": "でも、次の公演のセンターは歩だ。まず、歩がどんな\nダンスを見せたいかが、一番大事じゃないか？", "zh": "不过，这次公演的Center是步。\n步想展现出什么样的舞蹈，才是最重要的不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "14b79a87cf216fc54851c318fb40485cc541eb95199aa13d2969c44b82d77013", "ja": "ハッ！？　そ、そうでした……。", "zh": "啊！？说、说得也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2003_021mat", "source_sha256": "64c113f8dc7b7fe25e4412041d5f2b78d4250f10cda2160aa057ba0059fcb2e3", "ja": "もちろんなのです。\n歩ちゃんのやりたいことが、一番なのですよ。", "zh": "这是当然的呀。\n小步想做的事情才是最重要的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2004_p", "source_sha256": "4270aaf73c2c8aa887f43db572ff54a481b00778e33d86622c85cdccf82fbb45", "ja": "歩、さっきやってみたいことがあるって\n言ってたけど……。", "zh": "步，你刚才不是说有个点子想试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_019_2005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3eb49b5b209aa07c453c06348d50dbe51064666eea912c7c10ec2654a8d13ba4", "ja": "あ……うん！　そうなんだ。\nうまくいくかどうか、わからないんだけど。", "zh": "啊……嗯！对呀。\n但我不知道能不能顺利达成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
